export function buyNpcStock(npcId,itemId){const npc=dungeonNpcs[npcId],item=items[itemId];if(!npc?.stock?.includes(itemId)||!item)return {ok:false,message:'That item is not offered.'};const price=buyPrice(itemId,npcId);if(state.town.gold<price)return {ok:false,message:'Not enough gold.'};if(!canAddItem(itemId,1))return {ok:false,message:'Your pack is full.'};state.town.gold-=price;bumpCareer('goldSpent',price);addItem(itemId,1,{sourceType:'purchase',sourceName:npc.name,acquiredFloor:state.dungeon.floor});persist();return {ok:true,message:`Bought ${item.name} for ${price} gold.`}}
export function closeNpc(){const id=state.dungeon.currentNpcId,npc=state.dungeon.npcs.find(n=>n.floor===state.dungeon.floor&&n.id===id&&n.x===state.dungeon.x&&n.y===state.dungeon.y);if(npc)npc.resolved=true;if(id){const memory=state.town.npcProgress||(state.town.npcProgress={});memory[id]=(memory[id]||0)+1;if(id==='lost-surveyor'&&state.dungeon.floor>=2)state.dungeon.eventFlags['met-nell-deeper']=true}state.dungeon.currentNpcId=null;persist()}
export function descend(){const d=state.dungeon;if(d.x!==d.map.downStairs[0]||d.y!==d.map.downStairs[1])return 'Find the lower stair first.';if(d.floor>=3)return 'The stairs end at a sealed municipal door. For now.';d.floor++;d.deepestFloor=Math.max(d.deepestFloor||1,d.floor);state.career.deepestFloor=Math.max(state.career.deepestFloor||1,d.floor);if(d.floor>=3)unlockAchievement('deep-works');d.eventFlags['depth-marker-reached']=true;const map=floorMap(d.floor);d.x=map.upStairs[0];d.y=map.upStairs[1];d.facing=2;ensureFloorNpcs(d.floor);reveal();persist();return `You descend to level ${d.floor}. The air is warmer and the prices, presumably, are worse.`}
export function ascend(){const d=state.dungeon;if(d.x!==d.map.upStairs[0]||d.y!==d.map.upStairs[1])return 'Find the upper stair first.';if(d.floor===1){returnTown();return 'You climb back to town.'}d.floor--;const map=floorMap(d.floor);d.x=map.downStairs[0];d.y=map.downStairs[1];d.facing=0;reveal();persist();return `You climb to level ${d.floor}.`}
function retreatChance(enemySpeed=0){return Math.max(.2,Math.min(.9,.62+state.player.agi*.035+(state.player.class==='Rogue'?.08:0)+equippedEffect('retreatBonus')/100-enemySpeed*.045-(state.dungeon.floor-1)*.05-statusModifier(state.player,'slowed')*.05))}
export function retreatChancePercent(){const c=state.combat,enemySpeed=c?.speed??0;return Math.round(retreatChance(enemySpeed)*100)}
export function retreat(){const c=state.combat;if(!c)return {ok:false,message:'Use Return to Town to retrace a known route.'};const enemySpeed=c.speed??monsterForId(c.monsterId).speed,chance=retreatChance(enemySpeed);state.player.turns++;if(random()<chance){const name=c.displayName||monsterForId(c.monsterId).name;state.combat=null;tickTemporaryEffects();bumpCareer('combatRetreats');persist();return {ok:true,message:`You escape ${name}.`}}const msg=`Retreat failed (${Math.round(chance*100)}% chance).`+enemyTurn()+tickBurn();persist();return {ok:false,message:msg}}
export function collectFind(){const d=state.dungeon,cacheId=`cache-${d.floor}-first`,cell=d.lunchboxCell||[3,4];if(d.floor!==1||d.x!==cell[0]||d.y!==cell[1]||d.finds.includes(cacheId))return {ok:false,message:'Nothing else is here.'};const awards=[['blue-lunchbox',1],['stone-chip',1],['cave-salt',1]];const full=awards.filter(([id,q])=>!canAddItem(id,q));if(full.length)return {ok:false,message:'Your pack is full. Make room before collecting this cache.'};for(const [id,q] of awards)addItem(id,q);d.finds.push(cacheId);d.lootTaken=true;progress('loot','lunchbox');progress('loot','stone');persist();return {ok:true,message:'You recover Mara’s lunchbox, a stone chip, and some cave salt.'}}
export function collectGroundLoot(index){const d=state.dungeon,drop=d.groundLoot[index];if(!drop||drop.floor!==d.floor||drop.x!==d.x||drop.y!==d.y)return {ok:false,message:'There is no loose loot here.'};if(!canAddItem(drop.item,drop.quantity))return {ok:false,message:'Your pack is full. Make room before collecting it.'};addItem(drop.item,drop.quantity);progress('loot',drop.item);d.groundLoot.splice(index,1);persist();const item=items[drop.item];return {ok:true,message:item.slot?`Found: ${item.name}. ${item.rarity} · ${item.slot}. Open Inventory / Gear to equip it.`:`Collected ${item.name}.`}}
function applyOutcome(outcome,messages){const d=state.dungeon;switch(outcome.type){case 'message':messages.push(outcome.text);break;case 'gold':d&&(state.town.gold=Math.max(0,state.town.gold+outcome.amount));if(outcome.amount>0)bumpCareer('goldEarned',outcome.amount);else if(outcome.amount<0)bumpCareer('goldSpent',-outcome.amount);break;case 'item':if(!addItem(outcome.item,outcome.quantity||1,{sourceType:'event',sourceName:d.currentEventId||'dungeon discovery',acquiredFloor:d.floor}))d.groundLoot.push({floor:d.floor,x:d.x,y:d.y,item:outcome.item,quantity:outcome.quantity||1});else{progress('loot',outcome.item);if(items[outcome.item]?.slot)messages.push(`Found: ${items[outcome.item].name}. Open Inventory / Gear to equip it.`)}break;case 'removeItem':removeItem(outcome.item,outcome.quantity||1);break;case 'heal':state.player.hp=Math.min(state.player.maxHp,state.player.hp+outcome.amount);break;case 'damage':state.player.hp=Math.max(1,state.player.hp-outcome.amount);bumpCareer('damageTaken',outcome.amount);break;case 'effect':addTemporaryEffect(outcome.name,outcome.value,outcome.encounters);break;case 'flag':d.eventFlags[outcome.flag]=true;break;case 'townReaction':state.town.reactions=[...(state.town.reactions||[]),outcome.text].slice(-6);break;case 'unlockQuest':{const q=outcome.quest,known=[...state.quests.available,...state.quests.completed,...state.quests.active.map(x=>x.id)];if(quests[q]&&!known.includes(q))state.quests.available.push(q);break}case 'questProgress':progress(outcome.questType,outcome.target);break;case 'discover':if(!d.landmarks.some(l=>l.id===outcome.landmark&&l.floor===d.floor)){d.landmarks.push({id:outcome.landmark,label:outcome.label,icon:outcome.icon,floor:d.floor,x:d.x,y:d.y});d.eventFlags[`landmark:${outcome.landmark}`]=true;if(outcome.landmark==='warm-wall'){d.eventFlags['warm-wall-seen']=true;townFlag('warmWallDocumented')}if(outcome.landmark==='giant-stone-face')townFlag('stoneFaceReported')}break;case 'room':d.rooms[cellKey(d.floor,d.x,d.y)]=outcome.room;break;case 'encounter':{const key=monsters[outcome.monster]?outcome.monster:Object.keys(monsters).find(id=>monsters[id].id===outcome.monster);if(key){d.currentEventId=null;beginCombat(key,d.x,d.y)}break}case 'random':{const row=weightedChoice(outcome.outcomes||[],random);if(row)applyOutcomes(row.outcomes,messages);break}case 'skillCheck':{const classBonus=state.player.class==='Rogue'&&outcome.stat==='agi'||state.player.class==='Wizard'&&outcome.stat==='mind'||state.player.class==='Cleric'&&outcome.stat==='mind'||state.player.class==='Fighter'&&outcome.stat==='str'?1:0,success=(state.player[outcome.stat]||0)+classBonus>=(outcome.threshold||0);applyOutcomes(success?outcome.success:outcome.failure,messages);break}}}
